cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NCC: an agent-based model of nutritional carrying capacity for large herbivores"
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-15
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/RyanMartinEcology/NCC"
authors:
  - family-names: Martin
    given-names: Ryan B.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-6509-4767"
    affiliation: "Department of Fish and Wildlife Sciences, University of Idaho"
abstract: >-
  An R package that simulates nutritional carrying capacity for bighorn sheep
  (Ovis canadensis) with an agent-based model. Simulated females move under
  individual integrated step-selection functions, forage on a daily biomass
  landscape, and gain or lose body fat through an energetics submodel.
keywords:
  - agent-based model
  - nutritional carrying capacity
  - bighorn sheep
  - large herbivores
  - movement ecology
